Near real-time (1-15 minute delay) is achievable with all technologies:
- Dynamic Tables with short target lag
- Streams & Tasks with frequent scheduling
- Snowpark with triggered execution
- dbt with frequent scheduling (though less common)
{%- elif data_freshness_requirement == 'Batch' %}

### All Technologies Remain Viable

